			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>あら！？
あなたの　メダルボックス……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T12:28:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T12:28:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・ポケセン近くに配置
・メダルの比率でメッセージ分岐
　ぼうけん→woman3_02
　おたのしみ→woman3_03
　せんとう→woman3_04
　ちょうせん→woman3_05
　とくべつ→woman3_06
・割合が同じ場合
　とくべつ→ちょうせん→せんとう→おたのしみ→ぼうけん
　の優先度順
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T12:23:03" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WOMAN3</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T12:18:54" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c01_woman3_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>オレンジの　『ぼうけん』メダルが
ひときわ　かがやいているわ▼
じんせいは　アドベンチャー！▼
いくつに　なっても
ぼうけんしんを　わすれずにね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T12:27:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T12:19:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>オレンジの　『ぼうけん』メダルが
ひときわ　輝いているわ▼
人生は　アドベンチャー！▼
いくつに　なっても
冒険心を　忘れずにね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T12:29:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T12:28:50" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・ぼうけんの比率が高い
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-28T12:28:59" />
		</CommentCell>
